WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.423
(liquid pouring)

00:00:01.423 --> 00:00:02.840
- The Old Forge was named Britain's

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.741
most remote pub by the
Guinness Book of World Records.

00:00:05.741 --> 00:00:08.192
- It's located here in Knoydart,

00:00:08.192 --> 00:00:09.695
northern Scotland.

00:00:09.695 --> 00:00:11.432
Nearly everyone who
tries to get there dies

00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:12.755
in the flames.

00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:16.806
- Okay. This isn't
Mordor, but it is tricky.

00:00:16.806 --> 00:00:19.707
As we found out, one
does not simply walk to

00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:21.207
the Old Forge pub.

00:00:23.929 --> 00:00:25.691
Plan one: we take the train.

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:27.622
- Isn't that the train from Harry Potter?

00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:29.229
- Oh, it is.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:33.348
So, we pack our gear, jump on the train.

00:00:33.348 --> 00:00:35.582
- Enjoy the breathtaking scenery.

00:00:35.582 --> 00:00:37.191
- Arrive at the Old Forge.

00:00:37.191 --> 00:00:38.251
- Order a pint.

00:00:38.251 --> 00:00:39.084
And...

00:00:39.084 --> 00:00:40.733
(sighs)

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:41.780
- No, no, no. It doesn't work.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.488
The train doesn't come to Knoydart.

00:00:43.488 --> 00:00:44.891
It ends in Mallaig terminal.

00:00:44.891 --> 00:00:46.234
- Hey wait. Who is this guy?

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:48.639
- My name is Jean-Pierre Robinet,
and I'm the remotest

00:00:48.639 --> 00:00:50.562
public in mainland Britain.

00:00:50.562 --> 00:00:51.605
- Oh, okay.

00:00:51.605 --> 00:00:53.522
Plan two: We'll walk.

00:00:53.522 --> 00:00:54.632
- Here's the plan.

00:00:54.632 --> 00:00:55.795
We pack our gear.

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:57.478
- Fill up our water bottles.

00:00:57.478 --> 00:00:59.509
- Pack some snacks.

00:00:59.509 --> 00:01:03.218
- Prepare for the Scottish wilderness.

00:01:03.218 --> 00:01:05.612
- Enjoy the breathtaking scenery.

00:01:05.612 --> 00:01:07.339
- Arrive at the Old Forge.

00:01:07.339 --> 00:01:08.172
- Order a pint.

00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:10.057
And...
(sighs)

00:01:10.057 --> 00:01:11.148
- Well, you could.

00:01:11.148 --> 00:01:12.832
But to be honest, I don't think you would.

00:01:12.832 --> 00:01:15.905
Because it a 18 miles
hike, and is very boggy.

00:01:15.905 --> 00:01:19.072
No tracks. Just cross country
through the highlands,

00:01:19.072 --> 00:01:21.950
and you could carry all
your gears all the way up,

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:23.306
but I don't know. It's quite difficult.

00:01:23.306 --> 00:01:24.306
It's two days hike.

00:01:24.306 --> 00:01:26.673
One night in the (mumbles).

00:01:26.673 --> 00:01:27.937
- Okay.

00:01:27.937 --> 00:01:29.426
Plan three.

00:01:29.426 --> 00:01:30.637
We drive.

00:01:30.637 --> 00:01:31.734
We pack up our gear.

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:33.067
- We hire a car.

00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:43.114
- Make it a four by
four, and hit the road.

00:01:43.114 --> 00:01:45.092
Enjoy the breathtaking scenery.

00:01:45.092 --> 00:01:46.378
- Arrive at the Old Forge.

00:01:46.378 --> 00:01:47.214
Order a pint.

00:01:47.214 --> 00:01:49.154
And...
(sighs)

00:01:49.154 --> 00:01:50.509
- It's totally impossible to drive here.

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:52.742
The nearest road is 18 miles from here.

00:01:52.742 --> 00:01:56.269
So you need to park in
Mallaig, and jump on a boat.

00:01:56.269 --> 00:01:57.283
- Oh!

00:01:57.283 --> 00:02:00.690
- Full time I will say
around 130 people live

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:01.866
on the peninsula.

00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:04.134
Of course, the tourism is the
main part of our business.

00:02:04.134 --> 00:02:06.218
We're really busy between
the first of March

00:02:06.218 --> 00:02:07.924
and mid October.

00:02:07.924 --> 00:02:10.802
We've got the backpackers
and hikers because we on

00:02:10.802 --> 00:02:13.223
one of the two best hike in Scotland here.

00:02:13.223 --> 00:02:14.901
Here is totally unspoiled.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.983
Knoydart is clearly the
last British wilderness.

00:02:17.983 --> 00:02:18.888
- Okay.

00:02:18.888 --> 00:02:20.125
Final plan.

00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:21.543
We take the ferry.

00:02:21.543 --> 00:02:22.448
- We pack our gear.

00:02:22.448 --> 00:02:23.281
Buy a ticket.

00:02:23.281 --> 00:02:25.112
- Ge on the ferry.

00:02:25.112 --> 00:02:26.974
Enjoy the breathtaking scene of...

00:02:26.974 --> 00:02:29.960
My God, there are three
whales right next to the boat.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.383
- Whales, literally.

00:02:32.383 --> 00:02:33.549
- Arrive in Knoydart.

00:02:33.549 --> 00:02:35.196
Wave good-bye to the ferry Captain.

00:02:35.196 --> 00:02:36.563
Arrive at the Old Forge.

00:02:36.563 --> 00:02:37.764
Order a pint.

00:02:37.764 --> 00:02:38.682
And...

00:02:38.682 --> 00:02:41.857
♫ Congratulations

00:02:41.857 --> 00:02:42.893
- You made it.

00:02:42.893 --> 00:02:45.476
(upbeat music)

